WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 14]

01:57.760 --> 01:58.980
Where are you going?

02:12.150 --> 02:13.370
Try to find a decent cavern.

02:13.640 --> 02:14.300
It's all on you now.

02:44.040 --> 02:44.900
Can't you just go

02:44.920 --> 02:46.290
the normal way?

03:04.510 --> 03:05.620
I spent all those gems

03:05.870 --> 03:07.540
paying you to find me a cavern.

03:08.280 --> 03:09.570
You didn't find a cavern,

03:09.680 --> 03:10.900
and now I have to look for you?

03:48.800 --> 03:49.610
Little guy,

03:50.280 --> 03:51.450
you really found one!

03:52.630 --> 03:53.540
Now hide.

04:50.630 --> 04:51.890
It's pitch dark in here.

05:31.520 --> 05:32.410
There's even a tree?

05:33.280 --> 05:34.780
This place is something else!

05:47.430 --> 05:48.660
A spirit spring!

06:06.160 --> 06:06.660
Nice work.

06:06.750 --> 06:07.580
You actually did it!

06:07.830 --> 06:09.810
I didn't waste those gems on you.

06:12.240 --> 06:13.340
A natural spirit spring like this

06:13.600 --> 06:14.780
is truly a rare find.

06:15.360 --> 06:16.370
This cavern is ideal

06:16.630 --> 06:17.700
for cultivation!

06:21.560 --> 06:22.220
Here,

06:23.190 --> 06:23.810
your reward.

06:35.800 --> 06:36.900
Spirit herbs?

06:41.240 --> 06:42.810
How are they even growing here?

06:44.390 --> 06:46.050
Guess I can secretly grow herbs here

06:46.070 --> 06:46.930
without anyone noticing.

06:47.920 --> 06:49.540
It's Han Li's little herb garden.

06:53.950 --> 06:54.370
Stop!

06:54.680 --> 06:55.540
Hey, stop!

06:56.360 --> 06:57.100
Don't eat that!

06:57.480 --> 06:58.410
Listen.

06:58.630 --> 06:59.460
Too much of that

06:59.630 --> 07:00.490
will harm you!

07:00.920 --> 07:02.730
Those are my precious herbs, got it?

07:03.070 --> 07:04.050
Spit it out!

07:04.160 --> 07:04.900
Come on!

07:17.190 --> 07:18.140
There's a spirit spring here,

07:19.310 --> 07:20.340
and spirit herbs too.

07:22.310 --> 07:24.140
What a perfect spot for cultivation!

07:27.120 --> 07:27.850
Perfect spot.

07:28.360 --> 07:29.250
Absolutely perfect.

07:34.920 --> 07:35.810
You want a nap too?

07:41.480 --> 07:42.780
Unbelievable.

07:43.360 --> 07:45.100
You really know how to ride the wave.

07:55.830 --> 07:56.660
Careless of me!

08:00.870 --> 08:01.700
I need a defense array.

08:10.720 --> 08:11.460
All right.

08:11.720 --> 08:12.580
Job well done!

08:15.120 --> 08:16.020
Now,

08:16.120 --> 08:17.460
I need to plan this place out.

08:17.920 --> 08:18.610
First,

08:19.000 --> 08:19.700
I need

08:19.950 --> 08:21.100
a place to sleep.

08:24.000 --> 08:24.780
A bed?

08:26.480 --> 08:27.250
That'll do!

08:59.950 --> 09:00.490
Not bad!

09:01.240 --> 09:01.850
Pretty good, actually.

09:02.870 --> 09:04.050
I can have tea here.

09:07.430 --> 09:08.140
Enough now.

09:08.560 --> 09:09.610
I just fed you.

09:09.800 --> 09:10.490
Don't be greedy.

09:21.950 --> 09:22.980
How'd you get in here?

09:26.390 --> 09:27.900
Looks like Mentor Wu was right.

09:28.430 --> 09:29.900
Free arrays can't be trusted.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.220
Totally unreliable.

09:35.000 --> 09:36.900
Where can I get

09:37.190 --> 09:38.220
a proper defense array?

09:50.870 --> 09:51.490
Move aside.

09:59.190 --> 10:00.050
Yuanwu Kingdom?

10:04.160 --> 10:05.250
It's not far from Yue Kingdom.

10:05.560 --> 10:06.290
Quite close, actually.

10:08.720 --> 10:09.490
Maybe...

10:10.630 --> 10:11.610
I should take a trip there?

10:17.440 --> 10:18.100
Don't follow me.

10:19.840 --> 10:20.530
Stay here and watch the place.

10:21.510 --> 10:22.300
And don't let it come inside.

10:38.820 --> 10:41.300
[Heavenly Star Sect's Market, Yuanwu Kingdom]

10:41.670 --> 10:42.730
All right, deal!

10:44.150 --> 10:45.980
Congratulations on winning this treasure!

10:47.600 --> 10:49.980
Please head to the counter to claim your item!

10:51.870 --> 10:53.180
Yuanwu Kingdom may be small,

10:53.840 --> 10:55.060
but it's got quite a few arrays

10:55.320 --> 10:56.420
and some good crafting masters.

10:57.750 --> 10:58.940
With any luck,

10:59.360 --> 11:01.460
this auction may have something for my array setup.

11:02.630 --> 11:03.300
For now,

11:03.550 --> 11:04.820
I'll sell off some stuff first...

11:04.820 --> 11:06.000
One stalk of Golden Glow Ganoderma!

11:06.000 --> 11:08.220
[Millennium Golden Glow Ganoderma]
...Let's see what these guests have to offer.

11:10.200 --> 11:11.100
Ladies and gentlemen,

11:11.630 --> 11:13.060
the bidding now begins!

11:13.390 --> 11:14.130
Starting bid,

11:14.270 --> 11:15.610
I bid 500 gems!

11:15.870 --> 11:17.010
I bid 1,000 gems!

11:17.120 --> 11:17.980
1,000 gems!

11:18.320 --> 11:19.230
I bid 1,200 gems!

11:19.230 --> 11:19.850
1,200 gems!

11:19.870 --> 11:20.460
I bid 1,500 gems!

11:20.480 --> 11:21.610
- 1,500 gems! - I bid 2,000 gems!

11:21.630 --> 11:23.420
I'll trade a high-grade array

11:23.670 --> 11:24.580
for that spirit herb!

11:24.910 --> 11:25.940
A high-grade array?

11:26.320 --> 11:27.980
Oh, must be worth thousands, huh?

11:29.440 --> 11:30.010
Exactly!

11:30.270 --> 11:30.980
Sir,

11:31.320 --> 11:32.730
do you really have a high-grade array?

11:32.960 --> 11:33.580
I do.

11:34.720 --> 11:35.340
But...

11:36.600 --> 11:38.370
but it's not fully complete yet.

11:39.960 --> 11:40.610
Hey, you!

11:40.960 --> 11:42.100
What you've got is just junk.

11:42.480 --> 11:43.890
Stop making a fool of yourself!

11:44.390 --> 11:45.060
I bid 2,000 gems!

11:45.360 --> 11:45.890
2,000 gems!

11:46.390 --> 11:46.890
I bid 3,000 gems!

11:46.960 --> 11:48.460
Any more bids?

11:48.960 --> 11:49.850
Three thousand gems, going once!

11:50.240 --> 11:51.250
Three thousand gems, going twice!

11:51.600 --> 11:52.610
Three thousand gems, going three times!

11:52.910 --> 11:53.610
Sold!

11:55.320 --> 11:56.420
Congratulations!

11:58.150 --> 11:59.730
Please claim your item at the counter.

12:01.360 --> 12:02.250
Ladies and gentlemen,

12:02.360 --> 12:03.530
let's move on with the auction!

12:06.840 --> 12:08.300
Next item up!

12:20.080 --> 12:20.610
Stop right there!

12:24.270 --> 12:25.220
That's odd.

12:25.720 --> 12:26.770
I saw him run this way.

12:28.030 --> 12:28.580
Hey!

12:28.910 --> 12:30.530
Did you see a tall, skinny guy

12:30.630 --> 12:31.650
wearing a bamboo hat?

12:33.030 --> 12:33.580
Thanks!

12:33.670 --> 12:34.100
After him!

13:00.270 --> 13:01.610
This array is really something.

13:02.670 --> 13:04.420
If I have one like this,

13:04.870 --> 13:05.850
no little beasts

13:06.240 --> 13:07.610
will sneak into my cavern again.

13:28.240 --> 13:29.090
Earlier,

13:29.090 --> 13:29.910
[Qi Yunxiao, Artifact Crafter]

13:29.910 --> 13:31.490
thanks for stepping in.

13:32.240 --> 13:32.980
I didn't help you

13:33.150 --> 13:34.180
out of kindness.

13:35.000 --> 13:36.100
If you're also eyeing

13:36.240 --> 13:37.980
my array master's skills,

13:38.480 --> 13:39.610
you'd best move along.

13:40.910 --> 13:41.940
The Millennium Spirit Herb.

13:43.510 --> 13:44.610
Do you still want that?

13:49.580 --> 13:51.670
[Yunxiao Pavilion]

13:51.670 --> 13:52.610
Yunxiao Pavilion?

14:05.550 --> 14:06.650
Yunxiao is my first name.

14:06.790 --> 14:07.530
Qi is my surname.

14:11.840 --> 14:13.940
That Golden Glow Ganoderma is yours?

14:14.870 --> 14:16.100
Didn't you already sell it?

14:20.150 --> 14:21.060
Who says

14:21.750 --> 14:22.980
I can only have one?

14:23.840 --> 14:24.770
Fair enough.

14:25.550 --> 14:26.730
That's great news!

14:26.960 --> 14:28.100
May I take a look?

14:29.080 --> 14:29.700
Tell you what,

14:30.480 --> 14:31.460
you're a businessman.

14:31.720 --> 14:32.770
Let's talk business.

14:33.790 --> 14:35.530
Show me one high-grade item here,

14:36.120 --> 14:37.460
and I'll let you see

14:37.790 --> 14:38.530
my herb.

14:40.790 --> 14:41.770
Nothing here

14:41.910 --> 14:43.010
has caught your eye?

14:45.960 --> 14:46.580
All right then.

14:46.960 --> 14:47.610
Sir,

14:47.870 --> 14:48.650
this way, please.

15:11.670 --> 15:13.180
These arrays are really well drawn.

15:14.270 --> 15:15.460
No, not this one either.

15:22.240 --> 15:22.940
What's that?

15:23.080 --> 15:23.700
Don't touch it!

15:25.870 --> 15:26.850
It's for artifact crafting.

15:31.360 --> 15:32.700
Did you draw all these arrays?

15:33.550 --> 15:34.580
I specialize in crafting gear.

15:34.840 --> 15:36.370
The arrays are someone else's work.

15:36.840 --> 15:37.460
Sir,

15:37.630 --> 15:38.460
wait a moment.

15:49.550 --> 15:50.250
Sir,

15:50.630 --> 15:52.460
what do you think of this Five Phases Reversing Array?

15:53.510 --> 15:54.700
The Five Phases Reversing Array?

15:55.240 --> 15:56.890
That's the one that just exploded.

16:00.270 --> 16:01.250
Wait, that explosion

16:01.270 --> 16:02.770
wasn't the array's fault.

16:03.200 --> 16:04.300
I just didn't have enough gems

16:04.390 --> 16:05.250
to power it up.

16:05.440 --> 16:06.820
My array

16:07.000 --> 16:08.010
is an incomplete work now.

16:09.120 --> 16:11.490
It only runs at about 20% power.

16:12.360 --> 16:13.490
But even like this,

16:14.030 --> 16:14.610
it's still

16:14.720 --> 16:16.300
a top-tier defense array.

16:16.630 --> 16:18.370
It can block attacks

16:18.670 --> 16:19.890
from a Mid Foundation Establishment cultivator.

16:26.360 --> 16:27.580
What if you restore it?

16:28.150 --> 16:29.100
Once it's fully restored,

16:29.360 --> 16:31.010
it's more than enough

16:31.270 --> 16:32.650
to protect a small sect

16:32.750 --> 16:33.980
as the Mountain Barrier.

16:34.630 --> 16:36.370
A Millennium Golden Glow Ganoderma

16:36.720 --> 16:38.460
for a sect-level defense array?

16:38.910 --> 16:39.770
Sounds like a fair trade.

16:42.150 --> 16:43.490
But yours is still incomplete.

16:44.910 --> 16:45.610
Sir!

16:45.790 --> 16:46.460
Sir!

16:46.670 --> 16:47.530
Sir, please wait!

16:48.670 --> 16:49.220
Five years!

16:49.390 --> 16:50.580
Give me five years,

16:50.910 --> 16:52.850
and I swear I'll restore it to full form.

16:53.630 --> 16:55.420
You won't trade a Millennium Golden Glow Ganoderma

16:55.480 --> 16:56.700
for a broken array!

16:58.720 --> 16:59.250
Sir,

16:59.670 --> 17:00.820
are you interested

17:00.910 --> 17:02.060
in artifact crafting?

17:04.240 --> 17:05.100
You mean

17:05.670 --> 17:07.100
you're offering to teach me?

17:07.510 --> 17:08.490
To be honest,

17:09.240 --> 17:09.980
my grandfather

17:10.080 --> 17:11.820
was an elder in the Divine Arms Sect.

17:12.960 --> 17:14.100
All my skills

17:14.320 --> 17:15.490
came from him.

17:15.750 --> 17:16.770
Crafting artifacts

17:17.200 --> 17:18.340
is what I do best.

17:19.960 --> 17:20.730
I've got something else too.

17:21.340 --> 17:24.060
[Yunxiao Heart Technique]

17:26.670 --> 17:27.730
This Yunxiao Heart Technique,

17:28.480 --> 17:29.700
I compiled it myself

17:29.960 --> 17:31.850
over many years of cultivation.

17:32.390 --> 17:34.220
Besides this array,

17:34.720 --> 17:36.010
I'm even willing to break family rules

17:36.630 --> 17:37.580
and gift this technique

17:37.670 --> 17:38.650
to you.

17:39.120 --> 17:40.060
Because

17:40.200 --> 17:41.820
I truly need that Millennium Herb

17:41.840 --> 17:42.940
to save a life.

17:49.120 --> 17:49.850
Well,

17:51.080 --> 17:53.100
I happen to have a few materials to refine.

17:53.870 --> 17:54.610
So how about you

17:55.120 --> 17:56.700
forge a few sets of artifacts for me?

17:58.320 --> 17:59.610
As for this technique,

18:00.270 --> 18:01.250
if you can restore

18:01.670 --> 18:03.580
the Five Phases Reversing Array,

18:04.320 --> 18:05.820
I won't read a single page of this book.

18:06.670 --> 18:07.370
What do you think?

18:08.870 --> 18:10.370
And the Golden Glow Ganoderma?

18:12.840 --> 18:14.580
You need that herb

18:15.910 --> 18:17.250
to save someone?

18:18.630 --> 18:19.820
You're willing to trade it

18:19.910 --> 18:20.770
at any cost.

18:21.200 --> 18:22.530
That shows your sincerity.

18:24.270 --> 18:25.300
A life's on the line,

18:25.720 --> 18:26.820
I won't say no.

18:37.380 --> 18:38.620
[Yunxiao Heart Technique]

18:38.630 --> 18:39.220
All right.

18:40.000 --> 18:41.220
I've sealed the book.

18:41.750 --> 18:42.860
If you've made up your mind,

18:43.070 --> 18:44.660
just inject your spiritual power.

18:45.110 --> 18:46.090
Even I

18:46.350 --> 18:47.380
won't be able to open it.

18:47.720 --> 18:48.460
If one day

18:49.480 --> 18:51.220
you fulfill your promise,

18:52.030 --> 18:53.250
I'll return the book

18:53.440 --> 18:55.010
exactly as it is.

18:57.070 --> 18:58.770
You trust me this much.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.980
I'll give it everything I've got!

19:03.300 --> 19:05.100
[Yunxiao Heart Technique]

19:09.110 --> 19:09.700
Deal.

19:16.480 --> 19:17.140
Sir!

19:18.440 --> 19:20.180
Just follow the jade scroll's instructions

19:20.270 --> 19:21.420
and you'll activate this array.

19:21.720 --> 19:24.420
The sensory disruption feature

19:24.550 --> 19:25.380
isn't fully developed yet,

19:25.830 --> 19:27.860
but for pure defense,

19:27.920 --> 19:28.940
it'll hold up just fine.

19:30.160 --> 19:31.090
But...

19:31.310 --> 19:31.980
What is it?

19:33.000 --> 19:33.980
This array consists

19:34.270 --> 19:36.420
of eighteen secondary disks and one core disk.

19:36.750 --> 19:37.660
There are also

19:37.790 --> 19:38.860
thirty-six positioning banners.

19:39.110 --> 19:40.380
They're arranged in macrocosmic and microcosmic cycles,

19:40.640 --> 19:42.010
calibrated with Hetu-Luoshu divination patterns,

19:42.640 --> 19:43.860
and activated through the Primordial Eight Trigrams.

19:44.550 --> 19:46.140
Setting it up takes serious effort.

19:46.640 --> 19:48.220
If I had more time to refine it,

19:48.480 --> 19:49.290
maybe

19:49.640 --> 19:50.660
I could simplify it a bit.

19:51.270 --> 19:51.940
No worries.

19:56.550 --> 19:57.290
Next up,

19:57.920 --> 19:59.140
let's talk

19:59.310 --> 20:00.290
about artifact crafting.

20:05.070 --> 20:05.860
These are

20:06.030 --> 20:08.090
from a Level 2 Blackflood Drake?

20:08.750 --> 20:09.530
Horns,

20:09.720 --> 20:10.330
fangs,

20:10.440 --> 20:11.380
and venom!

20:13.310 --> 20:14.570
These are top-tier materials

20:14.680 --> 20:16.220
every crafter dreams of!

20:17.640 --> 20:18.980
You recognized them in a glance,

20:19.160 --> 20:20.220
looks like I came to the right person.

20:21.680 --> 20:22.570
How long will it take?

20:24.480 --> 20:25.380
Half a month will do.

20:25.720 --> 20:26.810
No problem, Han.

20:27.270 --> 20:28.250
With these materials,

20:28.440 --> 20:30.050
I can make several high-grade artifacts.

20:30.310 --> 20:30.900
Oh yeah!

20:46.750 --> 20:47.460
Qi,

20:48.480 --> 20:49.290
my name's Han Li.

20:50.750 --> 20:51.380
Good!

20:52.200 --> 20:52.900
This one's good!

21:31.030 --> 21:31.810
Done!

21:34.350 --> 21:34.900
Not bad!

21:35.400 --> 21:36.090
That's it!

21:43.750 --> 21:44.810
Wait, did I mess up a step?

22:13.000 --> 22:14.180
Guess I can't get careless with this.

22:14.790 --> 22:16.250
I should've asked Qi Yunxiao for more details.

22:17.510 --> 22:18.660
Now I'll have to wait

22:18.830 --> 22:20.090
until I pick up the artifacts in two weeks.

22:26.900 --> 22:29.340
[Ye Fei, meet me in the poplar woods. by Huang Long]

22:38.510 --> 22:39.220
Ye Fei,

22:39.920 --> 22:41.140
you faked your death once.

22:41.640 --> 22:43.180
You should've just stayed buried.

22:43.440 --> 22:45.050
Why drag your old crew back in?

22:45.790 --> 22:47.810
Is my name something you can call so casually?

22:48.720 --> 22:50.460
Back in Bamboo Sect,

22:50.720 --> 22:52.660
you had to call me Young Master.

22:54.310 --> 22:55.090
Fine.

22:55.720 --> 22:56.980
For old times' sake,

22:57.720 --> 22:59.330
if you hand over Volume One

22:59.350 --> 23:01.010
of the Great Deployment Art you stole,

23:01.200 --> 23:03.090
I can convince the Master

23:03.640 --> 23:04.620
to spare your life.

23:04.920 --> 23:07.140
Volume One?

23:31.310 --> 23:33.140
You really haven't changed,

23:33.590 --> 23:35.220
still so naive,

23:35.480 --> 23:37.700
still the loser at my feet!

23:39.680 --> 23:40.620
Earlier, he mentioned

23:40.920 --> 23:41.860
the Bamboo Sect.

23:50.310 --> 23:50.980
Oh no!

23:51.350 --> 23:52.290
A tracking mark!

23:54.680 --> 23:55.290
Who's there?

23:55.680 --> 23:56.250
Show yourself!

24:09.160 --> 24:10.220
He must have backup.

24:10.640 --> 24:11.380
I'd better get out of here.

24:27.160 --> 24:28.700
What is that?

24:46.790 --> 24:47.860
What's going on?

24:57.160 --> 24:57.900
Dead?

25:24.200 --> 25:24.980
A primordial spirit?

25:26.070 --> 25:27.570
Sir,

25:29.240 --> 25:30.770
if you help me find a new body

25:30.770 --> 25:32.180
so I can start over through possession,

25:32.640 --> 25:34.030
I'll pass on the Bamboo Sect's secret technique,

25:34.030 --> 25:35.460
the Great Deployment Art, to you!

25:36.440 --> 25:38.380
What's the big deal with a broken technique?

25:39.400 --> 25:40.900
All it does is control some puppets.

25:41.030 --> 25:43.140
This technique enhances your spirit sense!

25:43.680 --> 25:44.530
If cultivated properly,

25:44.720 --> 25:46.620
you can control over a hundred puppets at once!

25:46.920 --> 25:47.980
Over a hundred!

25:49.000 --> 25:49.620
So what?

25:50.160 --> 25:51.980
It also boosts your odds of forming a core!

25:54.270 --> 25:56.180
It helps with forming a core...

25:57.880 --> 25:59.010
Please, don't kill me!

26:04.000 --> 26:04.660
No.

26:20.310 --> 26:21.380
Tough luck for you.

26:22.110 --> 26:22.900
In this life,

26:23.720 --> 26:25.860
I'll never trust any body possessor.

26:38.830 --> 26:39.980
So intricate.

26:59.680 --> 27:00.530
Looks like it needs

27:00.550 --> 27:02.090
Bamboo Sect's secret technique to work.

27:04.110 --> 27:06.140
Could it be the Great Deployment Art?

27:08.640 --> 27:09.620
If I ever get the chance,

27:10.640 --> 27:11.530
I have to get my hands on it.

27:32.590 --> 27:33.900
I'm the Master!

27:35.550 --> 27:37.770
I am the rightful leader of Bamboo Sect!

27:38.510 --> 27:40.290
I have the first four volumes

27:40.590 --> 27:41.980
of the Great Deployment Art!

27:48.920 --> 27:49.810
No.

27:50.070 --> 27:50.900
If I don't remove this mark,

27:51.400 --> 27:52.570
they'll find me sooner or later.

27:53.240 --> 27:54.380
I need to figure something out.

28:11.920 --> 28:13.490
That was clearly just a tree.

28:13.790 --> 28:14.770
How is that the Young Master?

28:15.240 --> 28:16.420
Greetings, Young Master!

28:17.510 --> 28:18.250
Zhong Wu.

28:18.720 --> 28:19.460
Zhong Shu.

28:20.590 --> 28:21.770
You're with me now.

28:26.590 --> 28:28.050
I will serve you to the death!

28:28.310 --> 28:29.180
If I speak falsely,

28:29.550 --> 28:30.420
may heaven strike me down!

28:30.750 --> 28:31.570
May heaven strike me down!

28:38.400 --> 28:39.010
Here,

28:39.440 --> 28:40.140
take this.

28:40.920 --> 28:42.010
This is the list

28:42.160 --> 28:44.050
of Foundation Establishment cultivators from the Seven Sects.

28:44.720 --> 28:46.660
Recruit every name

28:47.200 --> 28:48.700
on this list for me.

28:49.070 --> 28:50.380
Once it's done,

28:51.440 --> 28:52.810
we'll meet at Yan Clan Stronghold.

28:53.550 --> 28:54.660
Yan Clan Stronghold?

28:56.720 --> 28:57.620
Congratulations, Young Master!

28:58.200 --> 28:59.140
That means

28:59.640 --> 29:00.570
Yue Kingdom is now

29:00.790 --> 29:01.700
wide close for the taking!

29:01.880 --> 29:03.380
Your grand plans are sure to succeed!

29:08.070 --> 29:09.730
You mean "wide open," right?

29:15.640 --> 29:16.180
Remember,

29:16.590 --> 29:17.700
it's "wide open."

29:20.720 --> 29:21.490
Shouldn't it

29:21.550 --> 29:22.940
be "gate close"?

29:26.000 --> 29:27.460
It really is just a tree...

29:43.780 --> 29:48.300
[Yunxiao Pavilion]

30:02.240 --> 30:02.980
Han!

30:03.160 --> 30:04.010
You're right on time.

30:04.010 --> 30:06.960
[Yunxiao Pavilion]

30:06.960 --> 30:07.860
Take a look at this,

30:08.350 --> 30:09.980
a flying artifact I forged

30:10.110 --> 30:11.420
using Blackflood Drake fin and tail.

30:12.070 --> 30:13.940
It doesn't offer much defense,

30:14.270 --> 30:16.050
but it's incredibly fast.

30:16.270 --> 30:17.140
I just

30:17.350 --> 30:18.980
haven't had time to name it.

30:24.510 --> 30:25.490
The fin contains

30:25.720 --> 30:26.860
wind element power.

30:27.440 --> 30:28.180
At this tier,

30:28.480 --> 30:30.380
few artifacts can match its speed.

30:35.680 --> 30:36.860
Wind Boat...

30:38.240 --> 30:39.010
Let's call it Wind Boat!

30:39.270 --> 30:39.810
What do you think?

30:40.960 --> 30:42.140
Swift as the wind!

30:42.310 --> 30:43.140
Great name!

30:44.070 --> 30:44.570
Han,

30:44.680 --> 30:45.460
check these out too.

30:47.920 --> 30:48.900
These are Drake Daggers,

30:49.110 --> 30:51.220
made from the Drake's fangs.

30:55.790 --> 30:56.620
This is White Scale Shield,

30:56.750 --> 30:59.250
crafted from its toughest outer scale.

31:01.880 --> 31:02.660
And this one

31:03.110 --> 31:04.010
is Azure Smoke,

31:04.070 --> 31:05.420
condensed from the Drake's venom.

31:05.750 --> 31:06.860
It should help you

31:07.270 --> 31:08.010
catch your enemies off guard.

31:13.350 --> 31:14.010
Qi,

31:14.110 --> 31:15.570
you actually managed

31:15.750 --> 31:16.980
to finish all this in fifteen days!

31:17.480 --> 31:18.180
I'm seriously impressed.

31:18.640 --> 31:19.860
I should be thanking you

31:20.270 --> 31:21.770
to that Millennium Spirit Herb

31:22.270 --> 31:24.090
Ruyin's condition has improved,

31:24.680 --> 31:26.700
so I could focus on crafting these.

31:27.790 --> 31:28.570
Ruyin?

31:32.000 --> 31:33.620
You risked everything

31:33.830 --> 31:34.810
just to save her.

31:35.350 --> 31:36.530
She must be the one you love, right?

31:41.440 --> 31:43.090
I bet you've got someone special too.

31:55.380 --> 32:00.460
[Yunxiao Pavilion]

32:01.200 --> 32:02.380
Wind Boat...

32:20.310 --> 32:21.490
A noble spirit within,

32:21.880 --> 32:23.220
the wind carries me far and free!

33:08.790 --> 33:09.730
You're the one

33:09.830 --> 33:11.420
asking to see our young master?

33:11.880 --> 33:13.010
Spit it out.

33:13.880 --> 33:15.090
It's raining

33:15.440 --> 33:16.730
and cold too!

33:17.160 --> 33:18.460
Weather changes fast these days.

33:20.000 --> 33:21.980
Bamboo Sect marked me with a tracking seal.

33:22.240 --> 33:23.570
They'll keep hunting me down.

33:24.070 --> 33:25.460
If Ghost Spirit Sect can shelter me,

33:25.590 --> 33:27.010
I'll offer the Yellow Maple Valley map

33:27.160 --> 33:28.010
in exchange!

33:30.510 --> 33:31.570
Not bad.

33:31.720 --> 33:32.980
You've come to the right place!

33:33.680 --> 33:34.860
Bamboo Sect...

33:44.030 --> 33:44.420
Boss!

33:44.510 --> 33:44.940
Awesome!

33:45.510 --> 33:46.010
My boss

33:46.270 --> 33:46.940
is seriously amazing!

33:47.310 --> 33:47.980
The hat.

33:53.640 --> 33:54.770
You're not messing with me, right?

33:55.160 --> 33:56.090
No way!

33:57.640 --> 33:58.810
This issue is easy to handle.

33:59.110 --> 33:59.620
Right?

33:59.750 --> 34:00.290
So...

34:06.750 --> 34:07.660
Relax, sir.

34:09.680 --> 34:10.700
Someone's around. Run!

34:38.160 --> 34:39.010
I didn't expect it.

34:40.480 --> 34:42.220
You're not just a demonic spy,

34:43.000 --> 34:44.050
you're with Bamboo Sect too!

34:45.270 --> 34:45.810
Ye,

34:46.640 --> 34:48.250
you've hidden too well all these years!

34:48.750 --> 34:49.900
Wu,

34:50.960 --> 34:52.810
you know too much!

34:54.200 --> 34:55.420
All these years,

34:56.200 --> 34:58.420
you've been blocking my profits.

35:01.200 --> 35:03.010
I should've killed you long ago.

35:04.830 --> 35:06.460
So this is who you really are.

35:07.160 --> 35:08.700
I'll never let you off!

35:12.510 --> 35:13.730
Kill him.

35:34.270 --> 35:35.860
Kill him!

35:54.550 --> 35:57.050
Die!

36:32.840 --> 36:33.570
Mentor Wu!

36:53.630 --> 36:54.210
Han Li!

36:54.840 --> 36:55.780
Go tell the Sect Leader

36:55.880 --> 36:56.570
that he's a traitor!

36:56.840 --> 36:57.530
He's working

36:57.550 --> 36:59.420
with demonic cultivators disguised as Spirit Beast Mountain disciples!

37:01.880 --> 37:02.820
Too late!

37:03.280 --> 37:04.530
Die with him!

37:21.550 --> 37:22.210
Mentor Wu!

37:22.510 --> 37:23.420
Grab me!

37:38.110 --> 37:40.090
Take them down!

37:51.320 --> 37:51.740
Mentor!

37:51.960 --> 37:52.460
Hang in there!

37:52.800 --> 37:53.820
My cavern's just ahead.

37:53.920 --> 37:54.860
There are pills that can save you!

37:55.190 --> 37:56.090
Forget about me.

37:56.400 --> 37:57.300
There's no time...

37:57.960 --> 37:59.130
Tell Master Zhong,

37:59.670 --> 38:01.490
the demonic sects planted spies in the Seven Sects!

38:01.840 --> 38:02.740
That Ye guy is one of them!

38:03.320 --> 38:04.980
The other sects are probably infiltrated too.

38:05.190 --> 38:06.570
Don't let them strike from inside and out!

38:06.920 --> 38:07.570
And,

38:07.800 --> 38:09.130
keep a close eye on Spirit Beast Mountain!

38:11.920 --> 38:12.490
Enough talking.

38:12.710 --> 38:13.610
Save your strength!

39:52.280 --> 39:52.980
Mentor Wu!

40:10.440 --> 40:11.170
Han Li!

40:12.360 --> 40:13.300
Give it up.

40:14.190 --> 40:16.010
That array won't protect you.

40:16.360 --> 40:17.130
Today,

40:17.960 --> 40:19.260
you won't make it out alive!

40:19.440 --> 40:20.740
No matter how hidden this place is,

40:21.400 --> 40:22.490
it's still Yellow Maple Valley territory,

40:23.000 --> 40:23.780
full of powerful cultivators!

40:24.230 --> 40:24.940
Aren't you afraid

40:25.280 --> 40:26.090
someone might find out?

40:29.800 --> 40:32.210
Still resisting on death's doorstep?

40:33.800 --> 40:35.420
Kill him.

40:35.710 --> 40:37.740
Blow it up!

40:58.880 --> 40:59.980
Only running at 20% power,

41:00.320 --> 41:01.490
and it's already this strong.

41:02.150 --> 41:03.460
A fully restored array

41:03.670 --> 41:04.820
will be perfect!

41:05.880 --> 41:06.980
If I survive today,

41:07.510 --> 41:08.460
I swear I'll finish

41:08.880 --> 41:09.530
restoring this array!

41:09.590 --> 41:10.210
Kid!

41:11.480 --> 41:13.300
You've got quite the array here!

41:13.550 --> 41:15.010
Hand it over to me.

41:15.760 --> 41:16.420
This time,

41:16.590 --> 41:17.650
I'll let you live!

41:20.030 --> 41:20.740
Want to learn it?

41:21.550 --> 41:22.210
Kneel.

41:22.590 --> 41:23.210
I'll teach you!

41:24.000 --> 41:25.380
Dream on!

41:41.150 --> 41:42.130
Han Li!

41:42.760 --> 41:45.380
The array's starting to collapse!

41:45.960 --> 41:48.260
You won't hold out much longer!

42:11.860 --> 42:17.180
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

42:18.420 --> 42:23.820
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

42:23.940 --> 42:27.140
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

42:27.380 --> 42:29.620
♪Old scenes rise again♪

42:30.020 --> 42:32.860
♪Too hard to forget♪

42:33.380 --> 42:37.340
♪Easier just to miss♪

42:38.180 --> 42:43.660
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

42:44.820 --> 42:50.100
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

42:50.700 --> 42:53.740
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

42:54.020 --> 42:56.140
♪Swept away by time♪

42:56.780 --> 42:59.420
♪Eyes once looked far♪

42:59.900 --> 43:03.860
♪Now lost in the shift♪

43:04.340 --> 43:07.180
♪Autumn winds stir♪

43:07.460 --> 43:09.380
♪Smoke curls once more♪

43:09.820 --> 43:12.260
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

43:12.580 --> 43:16.100
♪Returning to my eyes♪

43:16.660 --> 43:19.620
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

43:19.940 --> 43:22.860
♪Time lost its name♪

43:23.260 --> 43:26.100
♪Was it yesterday♪

43:26.500 --> 43:30.060
♪Or tomorrow?♪

43:30.420 --> 43:33.260
♪The world has changed♪

43:33.660 --> 43:35.500
♪Beyond recall♪

43:36.060 --> 43:37.780
♪Time will fade♪

43:38.180 --> 43:42.980
♪All the words ever spoken♪

43:43.660 --> 43:46.540
♪Only this longing remains♪

43:47.020 --> 43:52.300
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

43:53.420 --> 44:00.060
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

44:00.540 --> 44:10.260
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
